  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "The scroll bar is hard to use with hand tracking as the micro jitteryness causes the list to spaz up and down rapidly even when you are holding your hand still.\nThe more friends you have online, the worse it is to use.\nWhile you can use the thumb sticks instead, this is often too slow for days when a large number of friends are online.\nCould the scroll bar be smoothed so that it is more usable?",
